  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>The 2020 South Western Ontario Orthophotography Project (SWOOP) was acquired between March 7th, 2020 and May 20, 2020. The imagery consists of 105,684 frames of photography covering over 44,828 square kilometers.</p><p>For more information and to order stereo imagery products, please refer to the&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/GEO-Stereo-Imagery-Order-Form.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>GEO Stereo Imagery Order Form</a>.</p><p>For more information on the South Western Ontario Orthophotography Project (SWOOP)&nbsp;2020&nbsp;please see the&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/lio::south-western-ontario-orthophotography-project-swoop-2020-1km-index/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>SWOOP 2020 GeoHub record</a>.<br />&nbsp;</p><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>&nbsp;</div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><strong>Available Products</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>&nbsp;</div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><div>Stereo data -&nbsp;<span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal;'>Vexcel UltraCam X and Vexcel UltraCam X Prime frame based</span></span>&nbsp;- 12 cm resolution, 16 bit, RGBNiR (sizes vary, please see index) using ISAT Models for Stereo setup.<br />&nbsp;</div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/SWOOP2020_Stereo_Index_Geohub.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>South Western Ontario Orthophotography Project (SWOOP) 2020 - Stereo Frame Index (Shapefile)</a><br />&nbsp;</li></ul><div style='font-family:inherit;'><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px;'><strong>Contact</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px;'>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - Geospatial Ontario,&nbsp;<a style='color:rgb(0, 94, 149); font-family:inherit;' href='mailto: imagery@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>imagery@ontario.ca</a></div></div></div></div>"
